#    STEPS TO GET & INTEGRATE GEMINI API KEY (via Google AI Studio)
# 1. Go to https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Sign in with your Google account.
# 3. Click "Get API Key" → Create a new key.
# 4. Enable the Gemini / Generative Language API if prompted.
# 5. Copy the generated API key.
#
#    Required Installation:
#    pip install google-generativeai python-dotenv
#
# 6. Store the key safely in the `.env` file as:
#       GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# 7. Load the key using `python-dotenv`.
# 8. Configure the Gemini SDK with `google-generativeai`.
# 9. Use the Gemini model inside FastAPI to connect the chatbot backend
